From: Yang YiHe <108562510+nmhjklnm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:26:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/14] Preserve Gugu's opt-in incremental MCP argument
 previews

Why: Gugu already ships this behavior for #7536 as a dependency patch.
Keep it in the source build when taking the repeated-message-start fix,
so upgrading the bridge does not remove incremental MCP text previews.

Upstream: none yet; preserves the behavior shipped by Gugu #7536.
Drop: when upstream supports opt-in incremental MCP string previews,
including AIR clients, with equivalent split-escape regression tests.
---
